  "publicInfo.faq.eyebrow": "Short, practical answers",
  "publicInfo.faq.title": "Frequently asked questions",
  "publicInfo.faq.intro": "A quick guide to estimates, tutors, AI practice, plans, and the limits of this demo.",
  "publicInfo.faq.listLabel": "Frequently asked questions",
  "publicInfo.faq.oneQuestion": "How does Parle work?",
  "publicInfo.faq.oneAnswer": "A placement assessment starts your plan, which adapts after each check-in; AI tutor practice supports learning between lessons, and human-tutor booking is coming soon in this demo.",
  "publicInfo.faq.twoQuestion": "How does Parle estimate my level?",
  "publicInfo.faq.twoAnswer": "Each skill uses a 0–5 scale mapped to CEFR, with an approximate NCLC reference for Canadian goals, and carries “Estimate - not an official score.”",
  "publicInfo.faq.threeQuestion": "Are Parle estimates official results?",
  "publicInfo.faq.threeAnswer": "Only TEF Canada, TCF Canada, and other approved tests give official results; speaking is not scored automatically yet.",
  "publicInfo.faq.fourQuestion": "How are tutors vetted?",
  "publicInfo.faq.fourAnswer": "Administrators review each tutor’s profile, French introduction video, and credentials before manual approval; learners can review tutors after lessons once real booking is available.",
  "publicInfo.faq.fiveQuestion": "When can I book a tutor, and what will a lesson cost?",
  "publicInfo.faq.fiveAnswer": "Tutors set their own lesson prices, Parle adds no learner booking fee, and tutor booking is coming soon in this demo.",
  "publicInfo.faq.sixQuestion": "What does the AI tutor do?",
  "publicInfo.faq.sixAnswer": "It explains in your language, corrects writing, practises with you, and follows your weekly focus; it can make mistakes, is not an exam scorer or a replacement for a human tutor, and has a daily allowance by plan.",
  "publicInfo.faq.sevenQuestion": "What do Free and Premium include, and how do I cancel Premium?",
  "publicInfo.faq.sevenAnswer": "Free includes a placement assessment, a weekly plan and check-ins, and AI practice with a daily allowance; Premium includes those core tools plus a higher daily AI allowance under fair use for $14.99 a month or $119 a year USD; cancel on the signed-in plan/billing page, and Premium continues to the paid-through date.",
  "publicInfo.faq.eightQuestion": "How is my data used?",
  "publicInfo.faq.eightAnswer": "Account and learning data are used to provide Parle; avoid sharing passwords or highly sensitive immigration documents in AI chat.",
  "publicInfo.cancellations.eyebrow": "Help",
  "publicInfo.cancellations.title": "Cancellations, refunds and deleting your account",
  "publicInfo.cancellations.intro": "You pay for a lesson when you book it. Here is what happens to that payment if plans change.",
